# For run_link_e2e_scenarios.py, on top of autonomy_failover.parm and link_jam.parm.
# SITL only; not for hardware.

# ArduPilot's own GCS failsafe stays off, so any hold or return in the scenario
# is core's autonomy acting on the measured link, not the autopilot's fallback.
FS_GCS_ENABLE 0

# The dashboard bridge's link (SERIAL3 is the simulated GPS).
SERIAL4_PROTOCOL 2
